# A wide screen of 852x480 (fixtures/wide: holomap.keys's save outside
# the prison and the CD's LBA.CFG with WideScreen: ON, recorded with -D
# 1920x1080): the main menu's picture in the window of 640x480 in the
# middle, black around it, the list, then the scene on the whole screen,
# where Twinsen, sporty, runs along the path. Back in the normal
# behaviour, the inventory and the behaviours open in the window over
# the scene, the holomap in the window, F5's zoom fills the window's
# place in 4:3, bars beside it, P's pause writes in the window's lower
# left, and Escape's menu to quit opens in the window, where Continue
# goes on with the game.
hold 0.05
sleep 40
shot menu
key Down Return
sleep 3
shot list
key Return
hold 0.15
sleep 15
shot outside
key F2
sleep 1
down Left
sleep 1.2
up Left
down Up
sleep 6
up Up
sleep 2
shot walked
key F1
sleep 1
key Shift_L
sleep 3
shot inventory
key Escape
sleep 2
down Control_L
sleep 2
shot behaviour
up Control_L
sleep 2
key h
sleep 8
shot holomap
key Escape
sleep 6
shot back
key F5
sleep 3
shot zoom
key F5
sleep 3
key p
sleep 2
shot pause
key p
sleep 2
key Escape
sleep 2
shot quit
key Return
sleep 3
shot end
